sequenceDiagram
  actor E as Étudiant
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant MS2 as MS2 Quiz
  participant MS1 as MS1 Cours
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant MS5 as MS5 Duels et badges
  E->>GW: POST /api/quizzes/{id}/attempts
  GW->>MS2: requête avec jeton
  MS2->>MS1: OpenFeign : le cours existe ?
  MS1-->>MS2: 200
  MS2-->>GW: 201 score
  MS2--)MQ: quiz.completed
  MQ--)MS5: quiz.completed
  MS5->>MS5: points et badges
